{"3702120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Life & Shadow: Celestial Call", "steam_appid": 3702120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PREPARE BY DAY. UNCOVER SECRETS BY NIGHT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been assigned as an intern to an isolated observatory on Mount Clearveil; Professor Elias was supposed to welcome you, but the observatory is silent… and something is wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this psychological <strong>cosmic horror</strong> experience, you manage the observatory during the day and follow the traces of Professor Elias’s forbidden connection with the stars at night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/123ab98a4da5ca214cc83a1d2f699d27.poster.avif?t=1787929530\" width=780 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/123ab98a4da5ca214cc83a1d2f699d27.webm?t=1787929530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/123ab98a4da5ca214cc83a1d2f699d27.mp4?t=1787929530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MANAGE THE OBSERVATORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old devices, scattered notes, and unfinished experiments await you; as an intern, will you be able to handle the weight of this system?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/e801827b4a406551252504eb45477484.poster.avif?t=1787929530\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/e801827b4a406551252504eb45477484.webm?t=1787929530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/e801827b4a406551252504eb45477484.mp4?t=1787929530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HANDLE DAILY TASKS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You collect trash, grow and harvest crops, and try to keep the observatory clean and operational; yet the cursed symbols on the walls remind you that this place was never ordinary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/ecd0394d37ceafd9617124d64cb01fc5.poster.avif?t=1787929530\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/ecd0394d37ceafd9617124d64cb01fc5.webm?t=1787929530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/ecd0394d37ceafd9617124d64cb01fc5.mp4?t=1787929530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONTROL THE POWER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, you cannot understand why keeping the lights on is so important… until you are left alone in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/39a9bcb3a57faae7e6b87fb83cbda78c.poster.avif?t=1787929530\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/39a9bcb3a57faae7e6b87fb83cbda78c.webm?t=1787929530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/39a9bcb3a57faae7e6b87fb83cbda78c.mp4?t=1787929530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNCOVER THE OBSERVATORY’S SECRETS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A path that opens at night leads you beneath the basement and into the buried secrets of the observatory; to uncover them, you must be brave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/a1c92fbcca83c8a07921fddd7b1013aa.poster.avif?t=1787929530\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/a1c92fbcca83c8a07921fddd7b1013aa.webm?t=1787929530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/a1c92fbcca83c8a07921fddd7b1013aa.mp4?t=1787929530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOU ARE NOT ALONE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You think you are the one observing… but perhaps <strong>you are the one being observed</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/82592a0d7ce23a399d365b314fc5a4f6.poster.avif?t=1787929530\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/82592a0d7ce23a399d365b314fc5a4f6.webm?t=1787929530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/82592a0d7ce23a399d365b314fc5a4f6.mp4?t=1787929530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped.<br>Over time, you begin to lose your sense of reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you be able to escape this observatory, or will you answer the call of the stars?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Life &amp; Shadow: Celestial Call</strong> is an experience where calm and fear, science and madness intertwine. </p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PREPARE BY DAY. UNCOVER SECRETS BY NIGHT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been assigned as an intern to an isolated observatory on Mount Clearveil; Professor Elias was supposed to welcome you, but the observatory is silent… and something is wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this psychological <strong>cosmic horror</strong> experience, you manage the observatory during the day and follow the traces of Professor Elias’s forbidden connection with the stars at night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/123ab98a4da5ca214cc83a1d2f699d27.poster.avif?t=1787929530\" width=780 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/123ab98a4da5ca214cc83a1d2f699d27.webm?t=1787929530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/123ab98a4da5ca214cc83a1d2f699d27.mp4?t=1787929530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MANAGE THE OBSERVATORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old devices, scattered notes, and unfinished experiments await you; as an intern, will you be able to handle the weight of this system?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/e801827b4a406551252504eb45477484.poster.avif?t=1787929530\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/e801827b4a406551252504eb45477484.webm?t=1787929530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/e801827b4a406551252504eb45477484.mp4?t=1787929530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HANDLE DAILY TASKS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You collect trash, grow and harvest crops, and try to keep the observatory clean and operational; yet the cursed symbols on the walls remind you that this place was never ordinary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/ecd0394d37ceafd9617124d64cb01fc5.poster.avif?t=1787929530\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/ecd0394d37ceafd9617124d64cb01fc5.webm?t=1787929530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/ecd0394d37ceafd9617124d64cb01fc5.mp4?t=1787929530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONTROL THE POWER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, you cannot understand why keeping the lights on is so important… until you are left alone in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/39a9bcb3a57faae7e6b87fb83cbda78c.poster.avif?t=1787929530\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/39a9bcb3a57faae7e6b87fb83cbda78c.webm?t=1787929530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/39a9bcb3a57faae7e6b87fb83cbda78c.mp4?t=1787929530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNCOVER THE OBSERVATORY’S SECRETS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A path that opens at night leads you beneath the basement and into the buried secrets of the observatory; to uncover them, you must be brave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/a1c92fbcca83c8a07921fddd7b1013aa.poster.avif?t=1787929530\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/a1c92fbcca83c8a07921fddd7b1013aa.webm?t=1787929530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/a1c92fbcca83c8a07921fddd7b1013aa.mp4?t=1787929530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOU ARE NOT ALONE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You think you are the one observing… but perhaps <strong>you are the one being observed</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/82592a0d7ce23a399d365b314fc5a4f6.poster.avif?t=1787929530\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/82592a0d7ce23a399d365b314fc5a4f6.webm?t=1787929530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/82592a0d7ce23a399d365b314fc5a4f6.mp4?t=1787929530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped.<br>Over time, you begin to lose your sense of reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you be able to escape this observatory, or will you answer the call of the stars?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Life &amp; Shadow: Celestial Call</strong> is an experience where calm and fear, science and madness intertwine. </p>", "short_description": "You are trapped in the observatory of a star-obsessed professor atop Mount Clearveil. Plan your survival during the day, confront the darkness of the basement at night. Can you break the ritual and uncover the mystery?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Japanese, Korean, Russian, Turkish<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Portugal, Danish, Dutch, Finnish, Traditional Chinese, Polish, Norwegian, Swedish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/9f95f0447ef3e773ba19cbee3d1e6a53d46170e8/header.jpg?t=1787929530", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/99f3bc510dfd609547cde0b6f623f1633896c58e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787929530", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/99f3bc510dfd609547cde0b6f623f1633896c58e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787929530", "website": "https://immetastudios.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7600 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 (3 GB) / AMD RX 580 (4 GB) — DX11 compatible<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> The game may run on systems with 8 GB RAM, but performance may vary depending on background applications and settings.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 3600 / Intel Core i5-9600K or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 3060 (12 GB) / AMD RX 6700 XT or equivalent — DX11 compatible<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> These specifications allow the game to run at high settings with stable performance.</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "<strong>© 2025 Immeta Studios. All rights reserved.</strong><br><strong>Life & Shadow: Celestial Call </strong>and all associated logos, characters, and design elements are trademarks or registered trademarks of Immeta Studios.<br>Unauthorized reproduction or distribution of this game or any portion of it may result in civil and criminal penalties.", "developers": ["Immeta  Studios"], "publishers": ["PlayWay S.A."], "demos": [{"appid": 4091760, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}, {"id": "28", "description": "Simulation"}, {"id": "70", "description": "Early Access"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/fc1f89fa7666ef63df269975f46bdcde7acac0d8/ss_fc1f89fa7666ef63df269975f46bdcde7acac0d8.600x338.jpg?t=1787929530", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/fc1f89fa7666ef63df269975f46bdcde7acac0d8/ss_fc1f89fa7666ef63df269975f46bdcde7acac0d8.1